  "videoBrief": {
    "style": "soft watercolor on textured cold-press paper, Studio Ghibli-inspired, gentle pastel palette of pale blues and warm creams, hand-painted edges that bloom slightly, dreamy diffused light",
    "world": "a calm pale-blue lake at dawn wrapped in soft fog, faint silhouettes of pine hills far away, water like glass with slow gentle ripples",
    "characters": [
      "BOAT — a tiny rounded wooden rowboat with a warm red-brown hull and a small brass lantern glowing amber at its bow; empty, no people aboard",
      "FISH — a plump, friendly silver-teal fish the size of a cat, koi-like flowing fins, gentle smiling eyes, soft pink cheeks"
    ],
    "shots": {
      "p1": "The little BOAT drifts slowly from left toward center through thick soft fog, lantern glowing warmly, ripples trailing behind it; fog swirls gently as it passes.",
      "p2": "Beneath the glassy surface near the boat, the large friendly FISH rises slowly from the deep blue — a soft silver-teal glow growing under the water, nose gently breaking the surface at the end with rings of ripples.",
      "p3": "The FISH holds its head just above the water beside the boat, mouth open in gentle song; a slow stream of tiny glowing bubbles and soft light motes rises from its mouth into the fog (no musical notes, no text), the lantern light shimmering on the ripples.",
      "p4": "The fog thins and lifts slowly like a curtain rising, revealing more of the lake and the pine hills; light grows gradually warmer and brighter; the boat and fish rest together on the calm water.",
      "p5": "A warm golden sun climbs above the hills; the whole lake sparkles; the little BOAT glides slowly away toward the bright horizon with the FISH swimming alongside, two gentle wakes trailing behind."
    }
  },
